  m_Name: M4_Contact2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  messages:
  - "M\xF4n \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn l\xE0 m\xF4n To\xE1n, l\u1EA5y s\xE1ch to\xE1n,
    v\u1EDF ghi ch\xE9p ra th\xF4i!"
  - "V\u1EDF \u0111\u1EB7t l\xE0m sao \u0111\u1EC3 ti\u1EC7n cho vi\u1EC7c ghi ch\xE9p.
    S\xE1ch \u0111\u1EB7t \u1EDF ph\xEDa tr\xEAn \u0111\u1EC3 theo d\xF5i d\u1EC5
    h\u01A1n."
  - "Hmm... b\xFAt vi\u1EBFt c\xE1c th\u1EE9 h\xECnh nh\u01B0 \u1EDF trong h\u1ED9p
    b\xFAt th\xEC ph\u1EA3i? H\u1ED9p b\xFAt h\u01A1i to n\xEAn \u0111\u1EC3 \u1EDF
    ph\xEDa tr\xEAn \u0111i!"
  - "M\xECnh thu\u1EADn tay ph\u1EA3i n\xEAn \u0111\u1EC3 b\xFAt, com-pa, ... c\xE1c
    th\u1EE9 \u1EDF b\xEAn ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 oke."
